+
+### Bottom action bar (Substack-style, 5 slots)
+```
+🏠 Home   📖 Read   ➕ Add   💬 Chat   👤 You
+```
+- Fixed, `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)` aware (no iPhone home-indicator overlap).
+- Hides on scroll-down, returns on scroll-up.
