+   Stored in tsb_prefs_v2 and consumed by:
+     - the feed (topic weighting + tone)
+     - Lesson of the Day (length + depth)
+     - theme (night readers default to dark)
+     - language (whole app)
+     - the reveal: a real scoring pass over all 350 books
